  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square oil painting of a crowd of pastel vehicle like creatures with white window faces packed together, with a red bus at upper left, signed crump 11.",
    "description": "A square oil painting on wood, signed crump 11 at lower right. Rounded vehicle like forms with white window faces and dot headlights, in lime, pink, orange, teal, lilac and yellow, are packed together filling the frame, some with mitten shaped arms. A red bus with white windows sits at upper left against a pale sky. Thick black outlines over flat colour with visible brush marks.",
    "impression": "A traffic jam where the cars are soft and friendly, waiting patiently with their window faces. It is the town series meeting the crowd series: the same density, but the creatures have become vehicles. Gentle gridlock.",
